WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.836
♪♪

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.004
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:08.241
The 73rd annual
Primetime Emmy Awards

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.710
were hosted last night
by Cedric the Entertainer,

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.679
with an assist
from Rita the Rapper.

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:17.850
Around 400 people attended the
so-called Justice for J6 rally

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.752
over the weekend,
held at the Capitol.

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:22.655
Well, it's not as many
as they hoped for,

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:24.056
but that's still

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:26.526
a lot of reporters.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:27.927
During a lecture last week,

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.630
Supreme Court
Justice Clarence Thomas said

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.199
that the court had its flaws
and compared it

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.535
to a "car with three wheels."

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:38.872
Well, you know what you do
to a car with three wheels.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:41.074
Re-tire it.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:43.309
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:45.077
Do you follow what I'm saying,
Clarence Thomas?

00:00:45.077 --> 00:00:46.579
You retire it.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.647
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.647 --> 00:00:49.916
Mike Scollins liked it so much,

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.718
he wanted me to say
the punch line twice.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.221
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.658
He thought that maybe
the standing ovation...

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.026
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.026 --> 00:01:03.429
I would say it
over the standing ovation.

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:05.597
The House of Representatives
returned Tuesday

00:01:05.597 --> 00:01:07.466
from its August recess.
Oh, good.

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:09.635
Just in time for October.

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:12.238
In a new interview,
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden said

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.440
that their German shepherd
Major's habit

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.375
of biting Secret Service agents

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.511
has caused her
and President Biden

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:21.381
to delay bringing a cat
into the White House

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:23.683
because, as much as it hurts
to get bitten,

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:26.986
it hurts even more
to be ignored.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.555
[ Laughter ]
New York Mayor Bill de Blasio's
press secretary

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:32.125
announced yesterday that he will
step down next month

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.926
to open
a political consulting firm,

00:01:33.926 --> 00:01:37.029
which will teach aspiring
politicians, I guess,

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:38.397
what not to do?

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:41.200
[ Laughter ]
Customs officials said recently

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.636
that they have intercepted
thousands of packages

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.305
of fake coronavirus
vaccine cards from China.

00:01:46.305 --> 00:01:47.540
And you can tell they're fake

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.576
because they fit in your wallet.

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.844
[ Laughter ]
Tickets went on sale last week

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.913
for an immersive
experience based

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.614
on the Netflix show
"Bridgerton."

00:01:55.614 --> 00:01:58.418
And, as a reminder,
the first three rows are

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:01.087
in the splash zone.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.822
Ally.
Take it up with Ally.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:04.890
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.726
Yesterday was
National Wife Appreciation Day

00:02:07.726 --> 00:02:10.196
and Rudy Giuliani
got his a card.

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.498
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:15.935
And, finally, brewer Sam Adams
is releasing

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:18.271
a new limited-edition beer
that contains

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:21.574
28% alcohol by volume.
Said Boston residents --

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:24.276
[ Boston accent ]
Aw, Christ, not another
light beer.

00:02:24.276 --> 00:02:27.279
It was announced yesterday
that President Biden

00:02:27.279 --> 00:02:29.381
will follow
the FDA recommendation

00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:33.786
that those 65 and older receive
a coronavirus vaccine booster.

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:38.924
Well, he is used to needing
three shots.

00:02:38.924 --> 00:02:41.360
[ Laughter ]
During his address to the
UN General Assembly today,

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.629
President Biden announced
that the U.S. will make

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:46.332
a $10 billion commitment
to end hunger.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.566
Pretty impressive,

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:49.468
especially compared
to the previous president,

00:02:49.468 --> 00:02:52.271
who spent about 300 bucks.

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:55.508
Brazilian President
Jair Bolsonaro this morning

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:58.444
entered the UN General Assembly
hall unvaccinated,

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:02.115
violating both UN rules
and New York law.

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:05.451
But he got a hero's welcome
on Staten Island.

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:08.254
[ Laughter ]
Canadian Prime Minister
Justin Trudeau

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.023
won yesterday's snap election

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.824
and, in keeping
with Canadian tradition,

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:15.127
he gave a long, heartfelt
victory apology.

00:03:15.127 --> 00:03:17.030
[ Laughter ]
President Biden yesterday

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.365
recognized the 10th anniversary
of the end

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:21.634
of the Don't Ask Don't Tell
military policy.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:25.471
Now, Don't Ask Don't Tell
refers to Afghanistan.

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:28.240
[ Laughter ]
Former President Trump sent
a letter last week

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.510
to Georgia Secretary of State
Brad Raffensperger,

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.813
asking him to consider
decertifying the 2020 election.

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.448
Dude, just give up.

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:38.351
You know you don't have to be
president to play golf, right?

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:40.286
[ Laughter ]
According to a new survey,

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:41.721
9% of Americans said

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:44.824
that they drink less
than one cup of water a day.

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:46.425
At least, I think that's
what they said.

00:03:46.425 --> 00:03:48.094
Their voices were very raspy.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:49.162
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:50.696
Today was National New York Day.

00:03:50.696 --> 00:03:52.264
Ah, yes, finally,

00:03:52.264 --> 00:03:55.100
a day for New Yorkers
to think they're special.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.670
"Oh, you're from New York.
Uh-huh.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.271
And you say the pizza's
good there?

00:03:59.271 --> 00:04:01.073
Huh."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.073 --> 00:04:02.575
Authorities in New York
are searching for a man

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:05.144
who allegedly rolled a bike
onto the subway tracks

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:07.513
over the weekend,
which caused an explosion

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.148
when it was hit by a train.

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:11.250
Officials condemned
this behavior and said,

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.119
"When you're done
with the Citi Bike,

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:15.488
you're supposed to chuck it
in the Hudson."

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:17.223
♪♪

00:04:17.223 --> 00:04:19.992
Former President Trump filed
a lawsuit yesterday

00:04:19.992 --> 00:04:22.728
against The New York Times,
three Times reporters,

00:04:22.728 --> 00:04:24.096
and his niece Mary Trump

00:04:24.096 --> 00:04:26.065
for disclosing
his tax documents.

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:28.100
But he might've
given away the game

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.736
because he is suing for

00:04:29.736 --> 00:04:33.072
"100 million untaxable dollars."

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:34.240
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.675
After former President Trump

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:37.109
filed the lawsuit yesterday,

00:04:37.109 --> 00:04:40.146
Mary Trump said
that her uncle is a "loser."

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:43.048 line:0%
This first reported
by The New York Times.

00:04:43.048 --> 00:04:45.118 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
During his address yesterday

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:46.719
to the UN General Assembly,

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:50.356
President Biden spoke about the
upcoming World Climate Summit

00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:52.158
and called on leaders to,
"bring their

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:55.227
highest possible ambitions."
Said Australia --

00:04:55.227 --> 00:04:57.463
[ Australian accent ]
A knife that's also a beer.

00:04:57.463 --> 00:04:59.499
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.499 --> 00:05:02.668
According to a new book,
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:05:02.668 --> 00:05:05.137
told President Biden
on a phone call that he was

00:05:05.137 --> 00:05:09.074
"upset" that Biden called him
a killer in an old interview.

00:05:09.074 --> 00:05:11.978
Putin was apparently so upset
that two of his aides

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:13.279
committed suicide.

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:14.580
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.215
According
to new court documents,

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:18.651
former President Trump's
campaign knew

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:21.020
that the allegations
about broken voting machines

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.655
in the 2020 election were false.

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:26.158
Well, could you have clued in
Mike Lindell?

00:05:26.158 --> 00:05:28.293
Those machines made him go
full Joker.

00:05:28.293 --> 00:05:31.230
[ As Lindell ]
Want to know how I got
these scars?

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.464
Sharp corners

00:05:32.464 --> 00:05:34.500
on uncomfortable pillows.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:35.901 --> 00:05:37.870
In a new interview, British
Prime Minister Boris Johnson

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.105
admitted he has six children
and then,

00:05:40.105 --> 00:05:42.074
in a hard-hitting
follow-up question,

00:05:42.074 --> 00:05:44.510
they asked him
to name all of them.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:45.511
[ As Johnson ]
Uh, well, let's see.

00:05:45.511 --> 00:05:48.848
Well, there's Nigel.
Uh, Ian.

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:53.719
Likely a Colin, Walby, Parker.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:53.719 --> 00:05:56.655
The luxury toy car maker
The Little Car Company this week

00:05:56.655 --> 00:06:00.125
unveiled a child-sized
Aston Martin that will sell

00:06:00.125 --> 00:06:01.894
for $120,000.

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:03.595
The name is Bond.

00:06:03.595 --> 00:06:05.564
Unhealthy Parental Bond.

00:06:05.564 --> 00:06:08.767
[ Laughter ]
Reality star Kylie Jenner
yesterday unveiled

00:06:08.767 --> 00:06:11.070
the new products
from her Kylie Baby line,

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:14.406
which include shampoo,
conditioner, bubble bath,

00:06:14.406 --> 00:06:15.908
and lip injections.

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:18.778
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:21.013
Yeah, that's a huge drag
to look at.

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:22.648
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.648 --> 00:06:26.018
A winning Mega Millions lottery
ticket that is worth more

00:06:26.018 --> 00:06:29.622
than $400 million was sold
at a pizzeria in New York.

00:06:29.622 --> 00:06:31.857
Even crazier, they also sold one

00:06:31.857 --> 00:06:34.260
of those slices
with ziti on top of it.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.029
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:39.131
And, finally,
Amazon announced yesterday

00:06:39.131 --> 00:06:40.866
that it is lobbying
the federal government

00:06:40.866 --> 00:06:44.737
to legalize marijuana,
so, now, it's called...

00:06:44.737 --> 00:06:45.938
♪♪

00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:48.040
President Biden
spoke yesterday

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.309
to French President
Emmanuel Macron

00:06:50.309 --> 00:06:53.279
and acknowledged that the U.S.
should've consulted with France

00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:56.482
before announcing a new security
pact with the UK and Australia.

00:06:56.482 --> 00:06:58.951
But let's be honest,
France has done

00:06:58.951 --> 00:07:01.821
some crazy stuff
without consulting us.

00:07:01.821 --> 00:07:05.190
She's 150 feet tall, France.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:08.561
[ Laughter ]
You don't just get someone that
without asking.

00:07:08.561 --> 00:07:11.263
Space is hard to come by
in New York.

00:07:11.263 --> 00:07:12.864
President Biden hosted
three different groups

00:07:12.864 --> 00:07:15.167
of Democratic lawmakers
at the White House yesterday

00:07:15.167 --> 00:07:16.902
to discuss his domestic agenda.

00:07:16.902 --> 00:07:20.005
The Democrats were split
into progressives, moderates,

00:07:20.005 --> 00:07:21.440
and Republicans.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.543
A former FDA commissioner said,
in an interview yesterday,

00:07:24.543 --> 00:07:27.913
that the upcoming flu season
will be a "whopper."

00:07:27.913 --> 00:07:29.448
Apparently,
it's going to be so bad,

00:07:29.448 --> 00:07:32.284
as much as 60% of the country

00:07:32.284 --> 00:07:33.552
will think it's real.

00:07:33.552 --> 00:07:35.788
[ Laughter ]
President Biden had lunch today

00:07:35.788 --> 00:07:37.456
with Vice President
Kamala Harris.

00:07:37.456 --> 00:07:40.659
Unfortunately, the menu was one
of those QR codes

00:07:40.659 --> 00:07:42.495
and it took him 45 minutes
to order.

00:07:42.495 --> 00:07:43.896
[ Laughter ]

00:07:43.896 --> 00:07:46.299
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
yesterday named his pick

00:07:46.299 --> 00:07:48.100
for the state's new
surgeon general

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.102
and I guess the good news is

00:07:50.102 --> 00:07:52.204
he's technically a doctor.

00:07:52.204 --> 00:07:53.372
[ Laughter ]

00:07:53.372 --> 00:07:55.341
A group of House Republicans
on Tuesday

00:07:55.341 --> 00:07:58.210
filed articles of impeachment
against President Biden

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.479
and, in the interest
of bipartisan unity,

00:08:00.479 --> 00:08:02.481
he's agreed to step down.

00:08:02.481 --> 00:08:04.716
[ As Biden ]
We got to work together, folks.

00:08:04.716 --> 00:08:07.553
Authorities in Italy recently
arrested a Catholic priest

00:08:07.553 --> 00:08:09.054
for allegedly stealing more

00:08:09.054 --> 00:08:12.191
than $100,000 in funds
from his parish

00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:14.327
to pay for drugs,
and it gets worse --

00:08:14.327 --> 00:08:17.096
the drugs were
Flintstones chewables.

00:08:17.096 --> 00:08:18.630
[ Laughter ]

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:19.765
I'm just kidding.
It was crack.

00:08:19.765 --> 00:08:20.833
Allegedly.

00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:22.701
[ Laughter ]

00:08:22.701 --> 00:08:24.170
Two fire departments
in Illinois

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:25.471
rescued a dog this week

00:08:25.471 --> 00:08:27.439
after it fell
down a 40-foot well.

00:08:27.439 --> 00:08:29.208
"Right, fell,"

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:30.409
said the cat.

00:08:30.409 --> 00:08:31.543
[ Laughter ]

00:08:31.543 --> 00:08:33.278
Singer Billie Eilish
announced yesterday

00:08:33.278 --> 00:08:35.181
that she partnered with Nike
to create shoes

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:37.283
that are 100% vegan
and get this --

00:08:37.283 --> 00:08:40.386
they actually taste
like real meat.

00:08:40.386 --> 00:08:41.953
[ Laughter ]

00:08:41.953 --> 00:08:43.622
An online store started selling

00:08:43.622 --> 00:08:46.258
a sexy Halloween costume
version of

00:08:46.258 --> 00:08:49.061
Vermont Senator Bernie Sanders'
inauguration outfit.

00:08:49.061 --> 00:08:50.862
Not as popular -- the sexy

00:08:50.862 --> 00:08:53.099
George W. Bush stuck
in a poncho costume.

00:08:53.099 --> 00:08:54.433
[ Laughter ]
And, finally,

00:08:54.433 --> 00:08:57.370
New York's Katz's Deli
and Hendrick's Gin

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.837
have announced they will partner

00:08:58.837 --> 00:09:01.373
to make a gin-inspired pickle.

00:09:01.373 --> 00:09:03.008
Also pickled by gin?

00:09:03.008 --> 00:09:04.910
The queen, on weekends.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:09.215
[ Laughter ]

00:09:09.215 --> 00:09:10.316
I was nice.

00:09:10.316 --> 00:09:11.884
I think it's probably
all seven days.

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:12.951
[ Laughter ]

00:09:12.951 --> 00:09:15.087
I pulled back, out of respect.

00:09:15.087 --> 00:09:16.622
[ Laughter ]
That was a monologue.

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:20.226 line:0%
♪♪

00:09:20.226 --> 00:09:21.360 line:0%
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

